 "title_zh": "纪录片颗粒",
 "line": "Observational 16 mm at night: handheld drift, rack focus, a mono lower third, an archival card, gate and grain.",
 "line_zh": "夜晚的 16 毫米观察式纪录片：手持漂移、焦点转移、等宽下方字幕、档案卡片、片门与颗粒。",
 "prompt": "Documentary grain style: observational 16 mm at night, handheld drift that settles, rack focus from the lamp to the book to the face, a mono lower third, a typed archival card, film gate and grain, dips to black, ambient bed.",
 "prompt_zh": "纪录片颗粒风格：夜晚的 16 毫米观察式拍摄，手持漂移后稳定，焦点从台灯转到书再到人脸，等宽下方字幕，打字档案卡，片门与颗粒，淡入黑场，氛围底音。",
 "essence": "It feels found and true: a camera held by a person, focus that searches and lands, a practical lamp as the only warm light, and the graphics of a field film. The texture frames the moment; it never decorates it.",
 "not": [
  {
   "style": "editorial-print",
   "difference": "Editorial Print is a light printed page; Documentary Grain is a dark projected frame."
  },
  {
   "style": "retro-crt",
   "difference": "Retro CRT is a green screen with scanlines; Documentary Grain is warm film with grain and dust."
  }
 ],
